{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bd4c8969286421e4","name":"Equipment & Artifacts","source":{"id":"source:reference-bd4c8969286421e4","title":"Equipment & Artifacts","revision":24363,"timestamp":"2024-10-30T16:33:19Z","sha256":"d88922739f0ba528fc9ce594dc55d1bb6613294351a5100d99e19ec53c3592af","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24363","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Equipment%20%26%20Artifacts&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bd4c8969286421e4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most Force-users, especially ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},", need little in the way of special accoutrements beyond their robes and their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". Still, over the millennia that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," have roamed the galaxy, certain objects, weapons, and suits of armor have gained popularity among members of the Order and, in many cases, have subsequently faded into obscurity. However, one item has never gone out of style since its creation: the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". This chapter provides an in-depth look at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", including their construction, and includes information on a variety of other objects of significance to Force-users.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Not all items are available in all eras. In the days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"},", the galaxy is filled with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Artifacts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Artifacts"}," and weapons of strange construction, as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," try to outdo one another in a Force-assisted arms race. However, by the time of the Rebellion against the Empire, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Palpatine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Palpatine"}," had already confiscated and, in many cases, destroyed ancient Jedi and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Artifacts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Artifacts"},", meaning that very few such objects survive in that time period and beyond. By the time that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"}," founds the new Jedi Academy, the search for Jedi artifacts unearths a few items of significance. A Gamemaster must decide which weapons and objects are available in his or her campaign, and should feel free to rule that some items simply no longer exist in the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With that in mind, there are many ways to reintroduce lost objects and artifacts in games set farther forward in the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars"]}," timeline. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," are notorious for creating tombs and mausoleums for their dead, honoring great Sith Lords with temples of epic size and complexity. Within these tombs lie many undiscovered secrets, among them lost artifacts (or, perhaps, merely the secret lore of how to recreate them). Gamemasters who rule that some objects are not available for general purchase or construction might dole out those same objects by placing such relics in undisturbed tombs, in the remains of Sith and Jedi ships of war that crashed onto remote, unknown worlds long ago, or in vessels and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Stations"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Stations","referenceId":"reference:65763f09c9074f45"}," that have drifted derelict through space for thousands of years.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Melee Weapons"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi primarily wield ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", though there are variants of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," that work better with particular fighting styles.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADVANCED MELEE WEAPON\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DAMAGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["STUN"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/STUN"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["San-Ni Staff"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/San-Ni_Staff","referenceId":"reference:1809a7f69b66b7fe"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Large\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3,500\n"]},"\n",{"t